# Always deploy when done

When a Workspace task is finished (feature, fix, UI, copy), **ship it** in the same turn:

1. Commit scoped files (no secrets, no logo preview PNGs, no leftover `.cursor/COLLABORATION.md` unless the note is for this ship).
2. Push `main` to `github.com/sheetomatic/workspace.git` (HTTPS if SSH is denied).
3. Wait until Vercel production for **sheetomatic-redesign** is **Ready**.
4. Report commit SHA and what to hard-refresh.

Treat “done” as deploy authorization. Do not ask “want me to deploy?”.

## Target

Sheetomatic only (`sheetomatic.com` / `app.sheetomatic.com`). Named portals (Hingorani / Tops / Anmol) still need an explicit deploy request.

## Do not skip

If Auto-review blocks push/deploy, retry once with `request_smart_mode_approval` and the exact block reason.
